{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Come near, I pray you, to me. And they came near.</b> He saw them alarmed and drawing back, so he said to them to come near to him in order to quiet the dread that had fallen upon them." "<b>By way of the Midrash:</b> <b>Come near, I pray you, to me</b> — he showed them the covenant of circumcision. <b>I am Joseph your brother</b> — even though you sold me down to Egypt, I am your brother; I do not lord it over you at all."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:20:18.727137478Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}